  "label": "family-oriented audience",
  "description": "The meme targets individuals who value family bonding and domestic traditions, particularly those who have a positive relationship with their mothers and appreciate expressions of familial pride in everyday activities like cooking. The visual of a mother and daughter making sandwiches together, combined with the text 'my mom makes the best sandwiches,' appeals to an audience that finds joy and affection in shared domestic moments and maternal competence.",
